ORIGINAL PROJECT ATTRIBUTION:

Original FlashAttention RTL implementation and design:
- Systolic Array architecture in SystemVerilog
- Cocotb testbench framework setup
- Golden model reference implementation

Original work from flash-attention-rtl repository (prior to SUBLEQ refactor).

---

SUBLEQ + φ-Born Attention Layer:

Author: Ahmad Ali Parr
Description: Deterministic attention mechanism based on SUBLEQ instruction set
            and golden-ratio-weighted action selection

Key contributions:
- Consolidated SUBLEQ interpreter with formal correctness proofs
- φ-Born (PBI) multi-head attention mechanism
- Brainfuck ↔ SUBLEQ-J bidirectional transpilers
- Formal verification of determinism, termination, type safety, and TC completeness
- Agent architecture for bounded autonomous execution
- J-array semantics for dynamic memory indexing

All new work is made available under the MIT License above.
